1
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:11,400
Indicators are extra lines that help you read the chart.

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,500
There are thirty of them, so use the search box.

3
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:20,500
Type part of the name to find one.

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:29,700
Click it and it appears on your chart straight away.

5
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,300
Each indicator gets a small tag. The eye hides it, the X removes it.

6
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:44,200
The pencil button shows the drawing tools.

7
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:50,800
The tools are grouped. This first group is lines and channels.

8
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:02,300
Pick Trend Line.

9
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:10,200
Now click and drag on the chart to draw it.

10
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:19,400
The second group has Fibonacci and Gann tools.

11
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:25,400
Click the pencil again to hide the tools.

